_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ddenysov","id":3142325,"login":"ddenysov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDIzMjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ddenysov/canope/commits/64928cd3f6eb505a49927cce905b08c571de1ff7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T20:06:53Z","email":"denisov1985@gmail.com","name":"Dmytro Denysov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T20:06:53Z","email":"denisov1985@gmail.com","name":"Dmytro Denysov"},"message":"I see that two new `.gitignore` files have been added to the project.\n\nThe first one, `.gitignore`, excludes the `.idea` directory, which typically contains IDE-specific settings for JetBrains IDEs like IntelliJ IDEA or PyCharm. Excluding this directory is a good practice as it prevents team members from having to deal with potentially conflicting IDE configurations.\n\nThe second one, `frontend/static/.gitignore`, excludes the `/dist` directory within the `frontend/static` folder. This suggests that `/dist` likely contains the build output (e.g., bundled JavaScript, compiled CSS, etc.) of a frontend application. It''s common to exclude build artifacts from version control as they can be regenerated and would otherwise bloat the repository.","tree":{"sha":"93ffd32faccf37ac71b6459894b09ae070735372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ddenysov/canope/git/trees/93ffd32faccf37ac71b6459894b09ae070735372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ddenysov/canope/git/commits/64928cd3f6eb505a49927cce905b08c571de1ff7","verification":{"payload":null,"rea