)\n```\n\nThe `frontend/sign_up/src/stores/counter.ts` file defines a Pinia store named \"counter\".  It manages a reactive `count` value (initialized to 0), a computed property `doubleCount` that returns double the count, and an `increment` function to increase the count. This store is designed for simple state management within the application.\n\n```\nIndex: frontend/sign_up/.__mf__temp/sign_up/localSharedImportMap.js\n===================================================================\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/frontend/sign_up/.__mf__temp/sign_up/localSharedImportMap.js\n@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@\n+\n+// Windows temporarily needs this file, https://github.com/module-federation/vite/issues/68\n+\n+    const importMap = {\n+\n+        \"vue\": async () => {\n+          let pkg = await import(\"__mf__virtual/sign_up__prebuild__vue__prebuild__.js\")\n+          return pkg\n+        }\n+\n+    }\n+      const usedShared = {\n+\n+          \"vue\": {\n+            name: \"vue\",\n+            version: \"3.5.17\",\n+            scope: [\"default\"],\n+            loaded: false,\n+            from: \"sign_up\",\n+            async get () {\n+              usedShared[\"vue\"].loaded = true\n+              const {\"vue\": pkgDynamicImport} = importMap\n+              const res = await pkgDynamicImport()\n+              const exportModule = {...res}\n+              // All npm packages pre-built by vite will be converted to esm\n+              Object.defineProperty(exportModule, \"__esModule\", {\n+                value: true,\n+                enumerable: false\n+              })\n+              return function () {\n+                return exportModule\n+              }\n+            },\n+            shareConfig: {\n+              singleton: true,\n+              requiredVersion: \"^3.5.17\"\n+            }\n+          }\n+\n+    }\n+      const usedRemotes = [\n+      ]\n+      export {\n+        usedShared,\n+        usedRemotes\n+      }\n```\n\nThe `frontend/sign_up/.__mf__temp/si