:{"date":"2025-06-16T19:16:17Z","email":"denisov1985@gmail.com","name":"Dmytro Denysov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-16T19:16:17Z","email":"denisov1985@gmail.com","name":"Dmytro Denysov"},"message":"Okay, I will review the provided files and identify areas for improvement.\n\n**frontend/root/yarn.lock**\n\nThis file has been deleted. As a general practice, it''s good to keep your dependencies up to date and remove unused ones.\n\n**infra/docker/node/v24/Dockerfile**\n\nThe Dockerfile looks good, and here are some possible improvements:\n\n*   Specify a non-root user:  To enhance security, create a non-root user and assign ownership of the `/app` directory to that user.\n*   Use multi-stage builds: This involves using one stage to build the application and another to run it, resulting in a smaller final image.\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM node:24 AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\n\nCOPY . .\n\nRUN npm run build\n\nFROM node:24-slim\nWORKDIR /app\n\nCOPY --from=builder /app/dist ./dist\nCOPY --from=builder /app/package*.json ./\n\nRUN npm install --production\n\nEXPOSE 9000\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"dist/index.js\"]\n```\n\n**frontend/root/docker-compose.yml**\n\nThe docker-compose.yml file is well constructed.\n\nOverall, the provided configuration is pretty standard and simple, but could benefit from the suggested improvements.","tree":{"sha":"650057df6acfb38e0d9fe1cd0972e89fc82516cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ddenysov/canope/git/trees/650057df6acfb38e0d9fe1cd0972e89fc82516cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ddenysov/canope/git/commits/20e6d935fec8ece5c6d0ab05cb9b9f15c7ca1883","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3142325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ddenysov/followers","following_url":