://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/commits/6829de0331f15d8c0834a545b891cf5dcf4ee584/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-06T12:40:39Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-06T12:40:39Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Implement initial project setup and documentation improvements\n\nThis commit addresses several items from your project feedback, focusing on foundational setup and documentation clarity:\n\n- **Docker:** Added `docker-compose.yml` for PostgreSQL and Redis. Updated `DEVBOOK.md` accordingly.\n- **Tailwind CSS:** Documented the existing Tailwind CSS v4 setup in `apps/cms` within `DEVBOOK.md` and `ROADMAP.md`.\n- **CASL:** Integrated initial CASL setup for permission management in `apps/cms`. Added `@casl/ability` and `@casl/react`, created a basic ability definition file (`apps/cms/src/lib/ability.ts`), and updated `DEVBOOK.md` and `ROADMAP.md`.\n- **Environment Variables:** Added `SENTRY_DSN` to `.env.example` and comprehensively documented all environment variables in `DEVBOOK.md`.\n- **CI/CD:** Implemented a basic GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) for linting and building the project. Documented this in `DEVBOOK.md`.\n- **Monorepo Structure:**\n    - Clarified the intended use of `packages/` and `modules/` directories in `GUIDELINES.md`.\n    - Created example structures: `packages/ui` (with a sample React Button) and `modules/example-module`.\n    - Updated `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to include `modules/*`.\n- **Documentation:**\n    - Updated `ROADMAP.md` to reflect Tailwind CSS and CASL status.\n    - Updated `DEVBOOK.md` sections for Docker, Tailwind, CASL, CI/CD, and environment variables to ensure accuracy and completeness.","tree":{"sha":"9de00b3076c40fa0f06c66c1496afe7830775d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/git/trees/9de00b3076c40fa0f06c66c1496afe7830775d3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/git/commits/6829de0331f15d8c0834a545b891cf5dcf4ee584","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Manu5921/projet-jules/commit/6829de0331f15d8c0834a545b891cf5dcf4ee584","node_id":"C_kwDOO3HNWtoAKDY4MjlkZTAzMzFmMTVkOGMwODM0YTU0NWI4OTFjZjVkY2Y0ZWU1ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Manu5921/projet-jules/commit/4070b51b34b5045f62bbe6b92d2c74d3a35453bd","sha":"4070b51b34b5045f62bbe6b92d2c74d3a35453bd","url":"https://api.githu