3bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/commits/4070b51b34b5045f62bbe6b92d2c74d3a35453bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/commits/2f9a0ed16164979ced31de200ec7898864caf858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-06-06T10:53:36Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-06-06T10:53:36Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"feat: Initial project structure for modular CMS\n\nI''ve set up the monorepo using Turborepo and pnpm workspaces.\nI also initialized the main Next.js 15.3 application (apps/cms) with App Router,\nTypeScript, React 19, and Tailwind CSS 4.\n\nCore dependencies installed include:\n- Next.js 15.3.3\n- React 19.1.0\n- Tailwind CSS 4.0.0-alpha.13\n- Prisma 6.9.0\n- Clerk 6.20.2\n- CASL 6.7.3\n- Module Federation (nextjs-mf) ^8.8.31\n- Vercel OTEL ^1.12.0\n\nConfiguration files for Next.js, Tailwind, PostCSS, and Prisma are created.\nAn .env.example file is provided.\n\nThe directory structure for the Next.js app (apps/cms/src) includes\nstandard layouts for auth, dashboard, api, and multi-tenancy,\nas well as components, lib, hooks, stores, types, and styles.\n\nInitial documentation files are created and populated:\n- DEVBOOK.md: Developer setup and technical guide.\n- ROADMAP.md: Project roadmap (short, medium, long term).\n- GUIDELINES.md: Coding and collaboration conventions.\n- CONTRIBUTING.md: Contribution rules for humans and AI.\n- MIGRATION.md: Stack update history, seeded with initial versions.\n\nNote: The @opennext/adapter for Cloudflare deployment could not be\ninstalled due to package availability issues and will be addressed separately.","tree":{"sha":"952751cf535979b17c0c85b97985c501123a5f6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/git/trees/952751cf535979b17c0c85b97985c501123a5f6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Manu5921/projet-jules/git/commits/2f9a0ed16164979ced31de200ec7898864caf858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/googl