,"verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2169738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CAMOBAP","id":2169738,"login":"CAMOBAP","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjk3Mzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/commit/32abf95625f0b473208bfc0c126c0334529a41d0","node_id":"C_kwDOO3LgfdoAKDMyYWJmOTU2MjVmMGI0NzMyMDhiZmMwYzEyNmMwMzM0NTI5YTQxZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/commit/dbb286c90f304fe6612c9eb89c13340825ca9c7d","sha":"dbb286c90f304fe6612c9eb89c13340825ca9c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/commits/dbb286c90f304fe6612c9eb89c13340825ca9c7d"}],"sha":"32abf95625f0b473208bfc0c126c0334529a41d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/commits/32abf95625f0b473208bfc0c126c0334529a41d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2169738?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CAMOBAP","id":2169738,"login":"CAMOBAP","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNjk3Mzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CAMOBAP","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/commits/dbb286c90f304fe6612c9eb89c13340825ca9c7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T20:13:45Z","email":"aliaksandr.babrykovich@callstack.com","name":"Alex Babrykovich"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T20:13:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: address backlog nits and add missing test coverage (#26)\n\n* chore: address backlog nits and add missing test coverage\n\nNits:\n- Remove unused #include <iostream> and #include <memory> (N-2)\n- Remove redundant -std=c++17 compile option (N-3)\n- Restrict SandboxReactNativeView field visibility to internal (N-6)\n- Downgrade FilteredReactPackage substitution miss log to Log.d (N-7)\n- Pin ktlint to 1.8.0 instead of latest (N-8)\n- Add missing trailing newlines to cxx headers (N-10)\n- Add explanatory comment for cmakeListsPath: null (N-11)\n\nTests:\n- allowedOrigins overwrite on re-registration with same origin\n- unregisterDelegate with unknown delegate is a no-op\n- findAll with non-existent origin returns empty\n- reset() releases shared_ptr references\n\n* fix(sandbox): suppress Fusebox LogBox toast in sandboxed runtimes\n\nClear __FUSEBOX_HAS_FULL_CONSOLE_SUPPORT__ via shared JSI utility\nso LogBoxData.addLog() never creates the undismissable\n\"Open debugger to view warnings.\" toast inside sandbox views.\n\n- Add cxx/SandboxLogBox.h with disableFuseboxLogBoxToast()\n- Android: clear pre-bundle in BindingsInstaller + post-bundle safety net\n- iOS: clear post-bundle in buffered executor (Fusebox re-sets flag\n  after didInitializeRuntime:, so pre-bundle clearing is a no-op)\n- Remove LogBox from TurboModule whitelist\n\nCloses #12","tree":{"sha":"1c0e3b242e1415f65748c35f7e7e002edb46ec74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/git/trees/1c0e3b242e1415f65748c35f7e7e002edb46ec74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/callstackincubator/react-native-sandbox/git/commits/dbb286c90f304fe6612c9eb89c13340825ca9c7d","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c0e3b242e1415f65748c35f7e7e002edb46ec74\nparent 781fcd038a9f141b66c0b77fe1281ed656926a14\nauthor Alex Babrykovich <aliaksandr.babrykovich@callstack.com> 1777580025 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777580025 +0200\n\nchore: address backlog nits and add missing test coverage (#26)\n\n* chore: address backlog nits and add missing test coverage\n\nNits:\n- Remove unused #include <iostream> and #include <memory> (N-2)\n- Remove redundant -std=c++17 compile option (N-3)\n- Restrict SandboxReactNativeView field visibility to internal (N-6)\n- Downgrade FilteredReactPackage substitution miss log to Log.d (N-7)\n- Pin ktlint to 1.8.0 instead of latest (N-8)\n- Add missing trailing newlines to cxx headers (N-10)\n- Add explanatory comment for cmakeListsPath: null (N-11)\n\nTests:\n- allowedOrigins overwrite on re-registration with same origin\n- unregisterDelegate with unknown delegate is a no-op\n- findAll with non-existent origin returns empty\n- reset() releases shared_ptr references\n\n* fix(sandbox): suppress Fusebox LogBox toast in sandboxed runtimes\n\nClear __FUSEBOX_HAS_FULL_CONSOLE_SUPPORT__ via shared JSI utility\nso LogBoxData.addLog() never creates the undismissable\n\"Open debugger to view warnings.\" toast inside sandbox views.\n\n- Add cxx/SandboxLogBox.h with disableFuseboxLogBoxToast()\n- Android: clear pre-bundle in BindingsInstaller + post-bundle safety net\n- iOS: clear post-bundle in buffered executor (Fusebox re-sets flag\n  after didInitializeRuntime:, so pre-bundle clearing is a no-op)\n- Remove LogBox from TurboModule whitelist\n\nCloses #12","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp87f5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA23MQAJepKy/mIsWIEecD6lKlGDr2\nx8lR6qZG7iqw7lbVxA+WXnhPFpVqakIu1xfcyuwK5+DjhWPAEBi0vZTszDI0HjX3\nCveahUZh7MhR1M4vvEMJ55TDiZzB1JQxCEcJlFkoTFZkBc/BpSPFSNKFfFEqaoGT\ntTsSCJKA1rT9vUQq4g3lqZ7x3dt/1Y46KqOUMCojNmUIL/v9vWgLI87cUqh5FL9C\n43G+ps2udr4nPOK7ngvnWMyqSy9b9/ORuIAmNb5zWaBCTdoWuckXkzjPd0Rt/1md\n0Q6T+98whuwFumwHvHj+S2KCNE5jCkM5ZFMW0ZB80r8SAe6hGZFMzYSQTe8r6lsT\n77qYP4BegCYkBl32aG5hKmrqnHa1cJiNL0fNOHJkkIWvyB33YQei2gKD9pGrVA+7\nuhV7SdiugHBhb+coaUXyR0zIEw+ECEDdLjc1t6zYFou4DgH+9QnBAagv1/J7YhYW\nasspgFV7ROYgnWXUtTQRR/qL3lQTv+KrkjaTu7Xq/aluJKCqVdWE9FvHgG+K7S8h\nMvChj3A9T3Ve++bU9QmQH66dKuH+yB306MkV59Eo/4Z+57FlLZNBDRG6jZWWeWdM\nw9WXM08vqQb+h/Hb+aFus7ckkvGlBHnhAXNbN99eOIGWObQMGkctn5UpH348XphA\nKUINYy3C35xtqWZ7V3TC\n=enMe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-30T20:13:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git