fb3e1357ac178927a6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/commits/cf6f780eb310ca02574a4948ee950eecb65b6a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-30T09:03:37Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-30T09:03:37Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"message":"(fix) Fix type error in DashboardGroupExtension\n\nConsuming components of the Common Library are running into type errors because of the use of the `styles` object in the `DashboardGroupExtension` component. This is an example of the error message thrown when attempting to run a Webpack build in the Dispensing app:\n\n```\nbuild: TS2322: Type ''{ children: Element; open: boolean; title: ReactNode; style: { border: string; }; }'' is not assignable to type ''IntrinsicAttributes & Pick<PropsWithChildren<AccordionItemProps>, \"children\" | keyof AccordionItemProps> & Pick<...> & Pick<...>''.\nbuild:   Property ''style'' does not exist on type ''IntrinsicAttributes & Pick<PropsWithChildren<AccordionItemProps>, \"children\" | keyof AccordionItemProps> & Pick<...> & Pick<...>''.\nbuild:     20 |   return (\nbuild:     21 |     <Accordion>\nbuild:   > 22 |       <AccordionItem open={isExpanded ?? true} title={t(title)} style={{ border: ''none'' }}>\nbuild:        |                                                                 ^^^^^\nbuild:     23 |         <ExtensionSlot name={slotName ?? title} state={{ basePath }} />\nbuild:     24 |       </AccordionItem>\nbuild:     25 |     </Accordion>\nbuild:\n```\n\nThis commit fixes the type error by removing the `style` prop from the `AccordionItem` component and adding a new CSS module to the `DashboardGroupExtension` component with the appropriate CSS.","tree":{"sha":"9587ce5d8b35b74e6e22a446f7a721d07e92cd02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/git/trees/9587ce5d8b35b74e6e22a446f7a721d07e92cd02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/git/commits/cf6f780eb310ca02574a4948ee950eecb65b6a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denn