,"html_url":"https://github.com/Muppasanipraneeth","id":141117659,"login":"Muppasanipraneeth","node_id":"U_kgDOCGlI2w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muppasanipraneeth","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/commits/7d9e896bcb45627d09401792ce6b2855e782372c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-22T20:29:10Z","email":"praneeth7077@gmail.com","name":"praneeth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-22T20:29:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) O3-4382: Consolidate Treeview component logic (#2375)\n\nFixes a data synchronization issue in the Results viewer component by removing the TreeViewWrapper component and consolidating its functionality into the TreeView component. Previously, both components were wrapped in separate FilterProvider instances, leading to them using different React contexts. Following this fix, both components now share the same context provider, ensuring proper synchronization.\n\nOther changes include:\n\nMoving data fetching and state management directly into TreeView\nUpdating tests to reflect component consolidation\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"577be3940235df3e3969fe95354a038686f2b614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/git/trees/577be3940235df3e3969fe95354a038686f2b614"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nurazizUGM-Intero5/OpenMRS-Module-Patient/git/commits/7d9e896bcb45627d09401792ce6b2855e782372c","verification":{"payload":"tree 577be3940235df3e3969fe95354a038686f2b614\nparent 0fe88cb4926c1db70428ea087420260f639ee848\nauthor praneeth <praneeth7077@gmail.com> 1745353750 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1745353750 +0300\n\n(fix) O3-4382: Consolidate Treeview component logic (#2375)\n\nFixes a data synchronization issue in the Results viewer component by removing the TreeViewWrapper component and consolidating its functionality into the TreeView component. Previously, both components were wrapped in separate FilterProvider instances, leading to them using different React contexts. Following this fix, both components now share the same context provider, ensuring proper synchronization.\n\nOther changes include:\n\nMoving data fetching and state management directly into TreeView\nUpdating tests to reflect component consolidation\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoB/wWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3a8QAB0/afPSkSPrvBSnGgEciw3u\nutywukkMYb3SuiTmoplap9lKGOc3TdQlUH5M4VwM2owOs9QKM1R6KXLLLNmITJMo\nrmI8CSc8AXF0HeFm5Yb8QKJf6RqtOdR9CpycGGFcvx09/+BBSMVnRqxnt+pCWfFw\n4lHhuLPMGZGtc0oKXAjK64zj7AVx0pIdIlBoAe3+9bU7nkRKloigY0tr3SyhzICi\n/jx25QPXbmfptQKEJJyZKgFsc+g9rgxvdVDBVuGqfGbhzAtc/20JIe/ab7lbAOcI\nLwchsj3ng72fs/R7VqKDCADjVtXMXdd1RmoJMdm6FgkzJpxIYzjte8K3A5TGgm9k\nmGIwO0mwDwrlkiwX7BMHfIz7l1FDxV49bkzlQ+FlloplmP5B18DlQIgMN20/ra5/\nfQAkwBFcqkDNjmeYE5yS6kXgofh2yrWTwDu2/ayBLgYD3alyVfGDUltnzKsoyFYg\nBgF7NXAMJ2+yDMwdf9eu8z1DUjt19Kw8A7rFZVWzRAbGeUG/PS36UXYqiNbvi0S2\nZtCsnjoPQwP+RZTcOavCc5U12SNvOVy8QcAHC/UAgedezZvQL2YzXOewA8NFFq5A\n4cLNzmMqWKSd31ogpzY3I4vHTZUgFGY25zTQ4WTjy3nP51h8oeMCg5vc0YBIRtGG\nAhT2qXp69+TVKHxGg4gI\n=0t8E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-06-07T05:14:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt