://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/1e71ba30be1e5208aeaf5b111a4f450c656bb306"}],"sha":"d70095f38115830d731d93840062ce2034e5ab09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/d70095f38115830d731d93840062ce2034e5ab09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop","id":33398393,"login":"alexanderop","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzk4Mzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/1e71ba30be1e5208aeaf5b111a4f450c656bb306/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-22T11:29:31Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-22T11:29:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): prevent XSS, reverse tabnabbing, and zip bomb attacks (#52)\n\n* fix(markdown-preview): sanitize HTML to prevent XSS attacks\n\nAdd DOMPurify sanitization to strip dangerous HTML/JavaScript from rendered\nmarkdown. This prevents multiple XSS attack vectors:\n- Script tag injection: <script>alert()</script>\n- Event handler injection: onerror, onclick, onload, etc.\n- JavaScript protocol links: javascript: URLs in raw HTML\n- Markdown links refuse javascript: by default (markdown-it security)\n\nAdd comprehensive security tests covering all attack vectors.\nBoth main render path and error fallback path are now sanitized.\n\nFixes: XSS vulnerability in HTML rendering (Severity: High)\n\n* feat(branch-creation): add instructions for creating a new branch with conventional commit naming\n\n* fix(security): add reverse tabnabbing and zip bomb protection\n\n- Add rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" to external links via DOMPurify hook to prevent reverse tabnabbing attacks\n- Implement streaming decompression with size limits (2MB max) to prevent zip bomb attacks in document sharing\n- Add comprehensive security tests for Mermaid XSS vectors and link rel attributes\n- Replace gunzipSync with streaming Gunzip for memory-safe decompression\n\n* feat(tests): add comprehensive examples and guidelines for testing Vue composables\n\n* feat(commands): add create-command and pr command templates with detailed instructions\n\n* refactor(share): remove redundant constructor callback in safeGunzip\n\nThe constructor callback was immediately overwritten by the ondata\nassignment, making it dead code. Simplified to only use ondata.\n\n* docs(commands): add language specifier to code block in pr.md\n\n* docs(skills): fix markdown formatting in vue-test-composable examples\n\n- Close code block properly before Lifecycle Dependent Example section\n- Add proper ## headings for Lifecycle and Injection Dependent examples\n- Add ## heading for useInjectedSetup section in helpers.md\n- Fix inline code formatting for inject() reference\n\n* docs(testing): add comprehensive testing strategy and style guide","tree":{"sha":"46845eb589c5edc891e0bd6d047ab9ee511454d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/46845eb589c5edc891e0bd6d047ab9ee511454d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/1e71ba30be1e5208aeaf5b111a4f450c656bb306","verification":{"payload":"tree 46845eb589c5edc891e0bd6d047ab9ee511454d7\nparent 83092b3a98c8416ef543444f06f3ce53c7c5eb3f\nauthor Alexander Opalic <opalic@gmx.net> 1763810971 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763810971 +0100\n\nfix(security): prevent XSS, reverse tabnabbing, and zip bomb attacks (#52)\n\n* fix(markdown-preview): sanitize HTML to prevent XSS attacks\n\nAdd DOMPurify sanitization to strip dangerous HTML/JavaScript from rendered\nmarkdown. This prevents multiple XSS attack vectors:\n- Script tag injection: <script>alert()</script>\n- Event handler injection: onerror, onclick, onload, etc.\n- JavaScript protocol links: javascript: URLs in raw HTML\n- Markdown links refuse javascript: by default (markdown-it security)\n\nAdd comprehensive security tests covering all attack vectors.\nBoth main render path and error fallback path are now sanitized.\n\nFixes: XSS vulnerability in HTML rendering (Severity: High)\n\n* feat(branch-creation): add instructions for creating a new branch with conventional commit naming\n\n* fix(security): add reverse tabnabbing and zip bomb protection\n\n- Add rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" to external links via DOMPurify hook to prevent reverse tabnabbing attacks\n- Implement streaming decompression with size limits (2MB max) to prevent zip bomb attacks in document sharing\n- Add comprehensive security tests for Mermaid XSS vectors and link rel attributes\n- Replace gunzipSync with streaming Gunzip for memory-safe decompression\n\n* feat(tests): add comprehensive examples and guidelines for testing Vue composables\n\n* feat(commands): add create-command and pr command templates with detailed instructions\n\n* refactor(share): remove redundant constructor callback in safeGunzip\n\nThe constructor callback was immediately overwritten by the ondata\nassignment, making it dead code. Simplified to only use ondata.\n\n* docs(commands): add language specifier to code block in pr.md\n\n* docs(skills): fix markdown formatting in vue-test-composable examples\n\n- Close code block properly before Lifecycle Dependent Example section\n- Add proper ## headings for Lifecycle and Injection Dependent examples\n- Add ## heading for useInjectedSetup section in helpers.md\n- Fix inline code formatting for inject() reference\n\n* docs(testing): add comprehensive testing strategy and style guide","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpIZ6bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhuYQAJrXxiCpKgJ6qHO0yeGjEneE\ns8OzU7Xq1xWOAOxKYUi56xbvywHebi4Xml6V5mLRvymc9VI8m+QfT07FzNWaTt9N\n4arIfm5HrkZezNVR9KIFJKKBbELFWiBu/njfb0zosjaM89oxPvXaWQIzp0UbibrZ\ndx4DwqfUfmDpp8MQJqr2+/7JIvEzoZ8QNSQCz0UaEyRJq+YFjbz5dxk5SjWW/2+W\n2ojkOVYR4S1FNns8NvnK5BrJ8MnmMxnUyNkBvIkYLfSFgPigMh4T4jAM7G8+WD7K\nBz0wJvVNF9e8b1mcNLj+is5HqLgqDH6MlKNz5BZKUi9nev6+qm8nC7JTKQiwY7et\nU1gUADk2vACyzIHWuy6yF8yJjtLoUmldXfe7Z08ypfS5XSH/qzTWQZjEorDVY2Tb\nIk5Y/hPAVR2eFkOEdd+/T3l3Eek24+YP/6GQj4mcW6GYOIre9kqMeA9x1M1wso9Q\njRVZTfH7sUjqjFBAosIWREbwKM+/MmpO2aptEUaoUpQNHxS3rN9eTCYExqlpVEFu\n1ZvWybp4F3i8CfpLKO0338LxCD9lsG30pbLABwLSlUF3i9+leOH5ev4SY9fnu449\n/BTi9ngBBJh3F5/oOUWfJ6LlzmVoLgNM13GPVc839lofRqQH4+VhMJ4+NRhvSRyQ\nO7x7WiFUX8hh+SfS7Lnh\n=OS2q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-22T11:29:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow