es and setup\n- Add initial integration test for documents module\n- Update share composable with minor changes\n\n* ci: add Vitest job and gate E2E tests on unit test success\n\nAdd unit test job using Vitest to run before E2E tests. E2E tests\nnow depend on Vitest passing, preventing unnecessary browser test\nexecution when unit tests fail.\n\n* test(documents): replace fireEvent with userEvent for realistic interactions\n\nuserEvent simulates real user behavior more accurately by firing\nevents in the correct order (focus, hover, click) rather than\ndispatching isolated events.\n\n* feat: add systematic debugging and root cause tracing skills documentation\n\n* chore: set haiku model for commit command\n\n* chore: upgrade vitest to v4.0.13 and update lint command\n\n- Upgrade vitest from 3.2.4 to 4.0.13 with new dependencies\n- Update lint command to use pnpm run lint:fix and add haiku model\n- Fix nullish coalescing linting issue in useDocumentShare composable\n- Add fix-pipeline and review-coderabbit command definitions\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit feedback on test infrastructure and documentation\n\n- Fix crypto.randomUUID polyfill to handle missing globalThis.crypto\n- Ensure test factory timestamps maintain createdAt <= updatedAt invariant\n- Improve find-polluter.sh script to handle glob patterns and empty results\n- Rename codeReviwer.md to code-reviewer.md (fix filename typo)\n- Add language specifiers to code blocks in documentation\n- Convert markdown emphasis headings to proper heading syntax\n- Add blank lines around tables per markdown standards\n- Remove unused jsdom direct dependency (only used as transitive)\n- Enhance review-coderabbit.md with resolution protocol and GraphQL queries\n- Resolve all CodeRabbit review threads with technical justification\n\nAll changes verified: tests pass, no regressions detected.","tree":{"sha":"01064a4c01a3d25fc9d36ab7ce1755e3af6c3c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/01064a4c01a3d25fc9d36ab7ce1755e3af6c3c7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/a045317d96299e0c015cf84d4e35ad3c0221d419","verification":{"payload":"tree 01064a4c01a3d25fc9d36ab7ce1755e3af6c3c7b\nparent 26b827d90e8c11b97ef68350a994622895b7eab5\nauthor Alexander Opalic <opalic@gmx.net> 1763806703 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763806703 +0100\n\nBetterstyle (#51)\n\n* chore: consolidate AI instructions into CLAUDE.md and add Vitest setup\n\n- Remove scattered GitHub Copilot instruction files (.github/instructions/*)\n- Remove blog-modular-monolith.md and TESTING_STRATEGY.md docs\n- Add Claude Code commands, skills, and agent configurations (.claude/)\n- Add Vitest configuration with test factories and setup\n- Add initial integration test for documents module\n- Update share composable with minor changes\n\n* ci: add Vitest job and gate E2E tests on unit test success\n\nAdd unit test job using Vitest to run before E2E tests. E2E tests\nnow depend on Vitest passing, preventing unnecessary browser test\nexecution when unit tests fail.\n\n* test(documents): replace fireEvent with userEvent for realistic interactions\n\nuserEvent simulates real user behavior more accurately by firing\nevents in the correct order (focus, hover, click) rather than\ndispatching isolated events.\n\n* feat: add systematic debugging and root cause tracing skills documentation\n\n* chore: set haiku model for commit command\n\n* chore: upgrade vitest to v4.0.13 and update lint command\n\n- Upgrade vitest from 3.2.4 to 4.0.13 with new dependencies\n- Update lint command to use pnpm run lint:fix and add haiku model\n- Fix nullish coalescing linting issue in useDocumentShare composable\n- Add fix-pipeline and review-coderabbit command definitions\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit feedback on test infrastructure and documentation\n\n- Fix crypto.randomUUID polyfill to handle missing globalThis.crypto\n- Ensure test factory timestamps maintain createdAt <= updatedAt invariant\n- Improve find-polluter.sh script to handle glob patterns and empty results\n- Rename codeReviwer.md to code-reviewer.md (fix filename typo)\n- Add language specifiers to code blocks in documentation\n- Convert markdown emphasis headings to proper heading syntax\n- Add blank lines around tables per markdown standards\n- Remove unused jsdom direct dependency (only used as transitive)\n- Enhance review-coderabbit.md with resolution protocol and GraphQL queries\n- Resolve all CodeRabbit review threads with technical justification\n\nAll changes verified: tests pass, no regressions detected.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpIY3vCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7IAQACkZUW1pKsEdfZbCKPbWSzvz\n/Qil5VQrH0FLSXPj77fxlUkcFDN9kPwon0Rw7rhEbwNNZHWHVgFbEjWNQoZVZZn+\nGsnAIVIplXc6gwvdcTMHG23rJIpV9PNTmk64sKXNjgOLQ21ZD5RZhaAeR8pPHI2n\n23MU8S9ptq198Ohbq/74E6usfMPzUC7fSfLNS/kUKcvIttrtpc4JKRuNVKmw1RZb\n9o+eo+QAPPIhONFWdq0vGZu22+bt4KHVUvAgcV7kCBBxbsXpQ+5jxWx+aSb6dDkR\nU+DT3PQipNTmKzzK0cV/TWhffDA3uulIHObH13du/C51WG4zc7C18OCnRjKw/4Df\nlJhcs+DFgRPe+1MPHQMOTLyqiXf3P+FIqSVC2PlwjBySmw6lBeth8umMIjA8BenF\njVRzqcCZ81kvpfhJac6Z+IhSQ6Zne/b68m6VSBXi1aB5tkurHQFL/cgPOfrPrhuq\n8lYHccqsla36P793MvGsdXRURTn+iL7tzsOMf2VqfxuEUleoYocfBg4xmDgrhE5b\n9bWnJmrMF8OXyL75pf5WSi1kI6/rID0ThxAmCAPQOQZi1+t1ebPRjHtZGeK6VqT/\np7c4lcDkeEROj8m7FumU4bV/I8czdKqs+4nQ0PuQp63sJek/p9vgbB3RXnTK1x96\n2JE7Dvd7HVuHTZO/+10T\n=CYqq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-22T10:18:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organ