","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/0d7140ffd3a5feaeafefc618bb66b7ea3841ed28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T20:42:34Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T20:42:34Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"message":"fix: restore defensive null checks in share composable\n\nFixes two bugs introduced in nullish coalescing refactor:\n\n1. Restore optional chaining for document null check\n   - Changed: !document.content → !document?.content\n   - Prevents: TypeError when document is null/undefined\n\n2. Restore || operator for empty string URL handling\n   - Changed: url ?? window.location.href → url || window.location.href\n   - Prevents: TypeError from new URL('''') with empty string\n\nBoth changes restore original defensive behavior and prevent runtime errors.\n\nIdentified by: CodeRabbit code review","tree":{"sha":"00ab6d773e86095981efb204def9032d50ea2c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/00ab6d773e86095981efb204def9032d50ea2c1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/0d7140ffd3a5feaeafefc618bb66b7ea3841ed28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c