tter timing and fallback strategies\n\n- Increase timeouts for sidebar visibility checks (5s -> 10s-20s) to handle CI slowness\n- Use keyboard shortcuts (g+t) instead of button clicks for more reliable sidebar toggling\n- Add explicit wait for sidebar toggle button in `waitForAppReady()`\n- Improve visibility check logic with try-catch and short timeouts\n- Add force click option to sidebar toggle button as fallback\n\nThese changes address flaky test failures in CI where tests time out waiting\nfor sidebar elements to appear. The tests pass reliably in isolation but fail\nin the full suite due to timing variations in CI environments.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c02ee73c78fff33afbd5d5b12af830b0f409efd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/7c02ee73c78fff33afbd5d5b12af830b0f409efd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/f02690af729f40418433a99ef3664861be613ddc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop","id":33398393,"login":"alexanderop","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzk4Mzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com