"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop","id":33398393,"login":"alexanderop","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzk4Mzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/117aedaa869df42b5e47f8a47a52772769487b35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-04T12:16:09Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-04T12:16:09Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"message":"refactor: apply Vue style guide component naming conventions\n\nRename all module components to follow the pattern: Module → Component Type → Modifier\n\nThis ensures components are grouped alphabetically by their relationship and improves discoverability.\n\n**color-theme module:**\n- ColorButton → ColorThemeButton\n- OklchColorPicker → ColorThemePicker\n- OklchChannelSlider → ColorThemeSliderChannel\n\n**documents module:**\n- DocumentDeleteModal → DocumentModalDelete\n- DocumentActionManager → DocumentManagerAction\n\n**editor module:**\n- MarkdownEditor → EditorMarkdown\n- MarkdownEditorSkeleton → EditorMarkdownSkeleton\n- MyCodeMirror → EditorCodeMirror\n\n**layout module:**\n- HeaderToolbar → LayoutHeader\n- StatusBar → LayoutStatusBar\n\n**share module:**\n- ImportDialog → ShareDialogImport\n\n**shortcuts module:**\n- CommandPalette → ShortcutsPaletteCommand\n\nAll imports, API exports, and references updated accordingly.\nTypecheck and lint passing ✓\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2246bbf950a5c373cac21fdaae70cef222ac148","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/c2246bbf950a5c373cac21fdaae70cef222ac148"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/117aedaa869df42b5e47f8a47a52772769487b35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop","id":33398393,"login":"alexanderop","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzk4Mzkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop/MarkVim/commit/117aedaa869df42b5e47f8a47a52772769487b35","node_id":"C_kwDOO3jgfNoAKDExN2FlZGFhODY5ZGY0MmI1ZTQ3ZjhhNDdhNTI3NzI3Njk0ODdiMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexanderop/MarkVim/commit/94cc9c1100da4a4bb7c55bb1a95f18325e69947d","sha":"94cc9c1100da4a4bb7c55bb1a95f18325e69947d","url":"https://api.github