starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/9cbca1772113f678eb31791989ac653473e1a145/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-04T10:10:10Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-04T10:10:10Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"message":"refactor: streamline command palette handling and improve shortcut management\n\n- Removed command palette position management from ShortcutsManager.vue, simplifying the opening logic.\n- Updated useShortcuts.ts to enhance keyboard shortcut handling and introduced a new commandPaletteItems computed property for better integration with the UI.\n- Deleted BaseModal.vue and replaced its usage with UModal in SettingsModal.vue and ShortcutsModal.vue for a more consistent modal experience.\n- Refactored BaseSwitch.vue to utilize USwitch for improved switch component functionality.\n- Enhanced SettingsModal.vue to synchronize modal state with the shortcuts store and improved the layout and functionality of settings options.\n- Updated tokens.css to override Tailwind''s default primary color with a dynamic accent color and adjusted Nuxt UI semantic colors for better theme responsiveness.","tree":{"sha":"c1142cc1b332dbdea43fcfcbf4c42f876ea71972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/c1142cc1b332dbdea43fcfcbf4c42f876ea71972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/9cbca1772113f678eb31791989ac653473e1a145","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.