hub.com/users/alexanderop/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/commits/a5240cc3f4b8f17bd5269beeda36f8338a2f4928/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-02T19:37:21Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-02T19:37:21Z","email":"opalic@gmx.net","name":"Alexander Opalic"},"message":"feat: Enhance module boundaries and event management\n\n- Added ''domain'' module to ESLint configuration for stricter import rules.\n- Updated color-theme module to export types from its API instead of internal store.\n- Refactored color-theme components to import types from the public API.\n- Deleted unused core module and its related files, renaming it to domain for clarity.\n- Updated documents module to import types from the new domain module.\n- Introduced per-module event definitions for documents, editor, layout, and shortcuts.\n- Organized event bus to aggregate events from all modules, improving clarity and ownership.\n- Moved shared markdown utilities to the markdown-preview module for better ownership.\n- Created architecture improvements documentation outlining changes and future plans.","tree":{"sha":"59a08cbd48953e797e8bafdd858ab1682d1eb0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/trees/59a08cbd48953e797e8bafdd858ab1682d1eb0a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexanderop/MarkVim/git/commits/a5240cc3f4b8f17bd5269beeda36f8338a2f4928","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33398393?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexanderop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/